# Security: Authentication, RBAC, Tenant Isolation

**Reference:** [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) Section 11-12 | [`SECURITY_AND_MULTITENANCY.md`](../../docs/ai-guidelines/SECURITY_AND_MULTITENANCY.md)

