## Audit Logging (All Mutations)

**Every write operation must be logged.**

```python
# ✅ CORRECT: Audit logging on mutation
async def handle_create_material(self, cmd: CreateMaterialCommand) -> UUID:
    tenant_id = get_tenant_id()
    user_id = get_current_user().id
    
    # Create entity
    material = Material(code=cmd.code, name=cmd.name)
    material_id = await self.repo.save(material)
    
    # Log mutation (tenant_id, user_id, action)
    logger.info(
        "Material created",
        extra={
            "tenant_id": str(tenant_id),
            "user_id": str(user_id),
            "material_id": str(material_id),
            "code": cmd.code,
            "action": "create"
        }
    )
    
    return material_id

# ❌ WRONG: No audit logging
async def handle_create_material(cmd):
    material = Material(code=cmd.code)
    await repo.save(material)
    return material.id  # ❌ No logging
```

